'' RUN: std/tz phase Z1 -- the TZif reader and POSIX TZ rules against pinned tzdata 2026f
'' fixtures (tests/codegen/tzdata): exact anchors, transitions both ways, POSIX strings,
'' every truncation and single-byte mutation of every fixture. On Linux and macOS it also checks
'' 2000 instants per zone against the C library's localtime_r; that half is run there by hand.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/tz-rules.tiko -o tests/codegen/tzrules.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/tzrules.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/tzrules.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
